    ("What is the difference between NPV and XNPV in Excel?", "NPV assumes regular, equal periodic cash flows; XNPV discounts cash flows based on exact, irregular calendar dates."),
    ("What does XIRR calculate in financial analytics?", "The internal rate of return for a series of cash flows occurring at specific, irregular calendar dates."),
    ("What does the CHOOSECOLS function do in Excel 365?", "It extracts specific column numbers from an array or table: =CHOOSECOLS(A2:Z100, 1, 3, 5)."),
    ("What do VSTACK and HSTACK do in modern Excel?", "VSTACK stacks ranges vertically on top of each other; HSTACK stacks ranges horizontally side-by-side."),
    ("What does the LAMBDA function allow you to do in Excel?", "Create custom, reusable spreadsheet functions using standard formula syntax without writing VBA code."),
    ("What is Flash Fill and what is its keyboard shortcut?", "An AI-powered pattern recognition tool that auto-populates data based on examples; shortcut is Ctrl + E."),
    ("What is Data Validation in Excel?", "A feature restricting the type or range of data users can enter into a cell, such as creating dropdown lists."),
